			<div class="content" id="post-content-4363757">
									

<p>Well, no. These aren't a group of friends who banded up because of having shared experiences of being LGBT. These are just the characters from a much larger ensemble who just somehow ended up waking up - Lana used to be a villain, Jym is explicitly mentioned to be a one-off gag character, Kahnak is a DnD nerd and Clyde leads a band. Hope and Essie don't really have backstories mentioned, but seeing none of them actually mentioned how they knew each other from before they woke up, it's very likely that they didn't have significant ties back then.</p>
